  Matches the promotional/social and in-store signage exactly. Cream block letters
  (.bf-fill-base) + wine script (.bf-fill-script) are coloured by the hero's CSS
  vars (--bfcm-cream / --bfcm-sale-script), so it stays on-brand in the band.
  The accessible name lives on the sibling <h1>, so this is aria-hidden.
